{"id":305,"date":"2016-05-16T12:49:22","date_gmt":"2016-05-16T12:49:22","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/masterbadminton.dev\/ask-a-question-on-service-rules\/"},"modified":"2016-09-01T09:48:06","modified_gmt":"2016-09-01T09:48:06","slug":"service-rules-questions-html","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/masterbadminton.com\/service-rules-questions.html","title":{"rendered":"Ask a Question on Service Rules"},"content":{"rendered":"<div id=\"ContentColumn\">\n<div class=\"Liner\">\n<div style=\"float: left;\"><\/div>\n<div id=\"c2_invitation_29125440\" class=\"c2_invitation\">\n<h2 id=\"INV\" align=\"left\">Questions on Service Rules<\/h2>\n<p>Type your questions here. Ask us anything about badminton service rules.<\/p>\n<div style=\"max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;\"><\/div>\n<h2 id=\"VisitorPages\" align=\"left\">See Other People&#8217;s Questions<\/h2>\n<p>Click below to see contributions from other visitors to this page&#8230;<\/p>\n<div id=\"c2_invitation_29125440_submission_block\">\n<div class=\"othervisitors\">\n<p><a href=\"service-box-for-singles-and-doubles.html\"><b>Service Box for Singles and Doubles<\/b><\/a>\u00a0<img decoding=\"async\" src=\"..\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/02\/star2.gif\" class=\"rstars\" \/><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"..\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/02\/star2.gif\" class=\"rstars\" \/><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"..\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/02\/star2.gif\" class=\"rstars\" \/><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"..\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/02\/star2.gif\" class=\"rstars\" \/><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"..\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/02\/star2.gif\" class=\"rstars\" \/><br \/>\nQuestion: I want to know that during Service , if serving player hit shuttle over the parallel court of opponent and shuttle falls inside right area\/side \u2026<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"othervisitors\">\n<p><a href=\"questions-on-service-rules-in-different-situations.html\"><b>Questions on service rules in different situations<\/b><\/a>\u00a0<